{"skill":{"slug":"finance","displayName":"finance"},"version":{"version":"1.1.2","createdAt":1769983031560,"changelog":"- fixed the series call to look at a series of a stock","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"scripts/market_quote.py","size":5972,"sha256":"0027df1c63aceddbec514f9e7c3f571b79e1bb4afa2653312e4e5436009ed288","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/market_series.py","size":2686,"sha256":"d66b3942bfc9810e6477992ef2ee0f8ab31fad92f296ce12b9323a7e64210e21","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/market_watchlist.py","size":3474,"sha256":"1ab5de3b27e659529457b3ad6b3fa5f479e77d02bb017737d56b37b6401cb8ea","contentType":null},{"path":"providers.md","size":1071,"sha256":"18b8c653ce92b0832d91a1439efb09cdf39062171b46b3a656322fa761cf47d3","contentType":null},{"path":"requirements.txt","size":51,"sha256":"c9751f9e3543a692c8729d66d28e0ce2e619bff25bad866e987ac3942fc5d716","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3238,"sha256":"42617a446a25787ec92ed34528e313b7f3a75f68c39a972a9b30067719c57917","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2229,"sha256":"21c275d03ff467d304eaf2a0dbb12f30ec3ceb3e82734e8e30e9eb871a366ff8","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789027311086,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"96af86f3d71575627277bf78c2114919a9dba7dec39f7eae6dd321e0e525213f","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/96af86f3d71575627277bf78c2114919a9dba7dec39f7eae6dd321e0e525213f","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: finance\nVersion: 1.1.2\n\nThe OpenClaw skill bundle is designed to track market data using public APIs and local caching. It uses `yfinance` for stocks/ETFs/indices and ExchangeRate-API for FX rates. File system operations are limited to a designated `.cache/market-tracker` directory for caching and watchlist persistence. The `market_watchlist.py` script uses `subprocess.run` to call `market_quote.py` within the same skill, which is a safe modularity pattern. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts against the agent beyond standard operational instructions.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160757389},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":95,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":12,"checkedAt":1789027311086},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a market-price helper that uses expected third-party data providers and local cache files, with some documentation overstatements and dependency hygiene issues but no hidden or destructive behavior found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to Yahoo/yfinance and open.er-api.com and writes under a local cache/watchlist directory are proportionate for market quote tracking.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The documented install runs pip against unpinned requirements for yfinance, pandas, and requests, which is a reproducibility and supply-chain risk, though the package names themselves are ordinary for this purpose.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Instructions are terminal-focused and disclose market-data fetching, caching, and watchlist use; no prompt hijacking, role changes, or unrelated agent-control instructions were found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Persistence is limited to local quote cache and watchlist JSON files under .cache/market-tracker; no services, startup hooks, credential stores, privilege escalation, or cross-session backdoors were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The scripts align with quote tracking for stocks, ETFs, indices, and latest FX rates, but the description overstates crypto support, provider fallbacks, and historical FX series support.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install this only in a normal isolated Python virtual environment, and consider pinning or locking dependencies before use. Expect it to contact Yahoo/yfinance and open.er-api.com and to create local cache/watchlist files. Treat claims about crypto, provider fallbacks, and historical FX series as limited or inaccurate unless the skill is updated.","findings":"[TP4] unexpected: Accepted as a documentation accuracy issue: the artifacts claim broader crypto and provider fallback behavior than the scripts implement, but this is not evidence of unsafe hidden capability.\n[LP3] expected: Downgraded: shell, network, and local state are expected for these CLI scripts, and artifact evidence does not show broad file access or unrelated commands.\n[SDI-4] unexpected: Accepted as an accuracy issue: the historical series usage example includes FX, while the script exits for FX historical series.\n[SDI-1] unexpected: Accepted as an accuracy issue: latest FX quotes are implemented, but historical FX tracking is not.\n[AST4] expected: Downgraded: the subprocess call uses shell=False with an explicit argument list to run the bundled quote script, so the cited pattern does not show command injection by itself.\n[SC1] expected: Accepted as dependency hygiene risk: the requirements use minimum-version constraints rather than exact pins or hashes.\n[SC4] expected: Downgraded: because requirements set pandas>=2.0.0 and requests>=2.31.0, the generic advisory uncertainty does not establish that a vulnerable installed version is required by this skill.\n[SQP-2] expected: Downgraded: SKILL.md and providers.md disclose the external market providers and caching behavior, although the exact runtime cache path differs from the frontmatter stateDir.\n[T08] expected: Accepted as a supply-chain caution because dependencies are unpinned and unhashed; not enough by itself to make the skill suspicious or malicious.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789027311086}}}}}